  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Veozah (fezolinetant), effective 2024-11-01. Approval criteria and explicit denials encoded; attestations and supporting documentation require manual review. Source says FDA labeled age; no numeric age cutoff is supplied.",
    "Therapy step: at least one failed agent from the listed hormone or non-hormone categories, or contraindications to both categories. No trial duration is specified.",
    "Cautions (notes only): serum transaminase elevations >3\u00d7 ULN have occurred; use with CYP1A2 inhibitors is not advised.",
